1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:02,372
Choose what each gesture does.

2
00:00:02,412 --> 00:00:06,080
Taps, holds and swipes,
for every app or just one.

3
00:00:07,346 --> 00:00:11,286
Open Actions.
In Gesture Volume, tap Actions.

4
00:00:11,326 --> 00:00:15,438
Every tap, hold and swipe the bar
understands is listed here.

5
00:00:15,772 --> 00:00:17,782
Try a gesture on the pad.

6
00:00:17,822 --> 00:00:20,332
The pad at the top holds your real bar.

7
00:00:20,372 --> 00:00:24,589
Try a gesture on it, and the line
below says what that gesture does.

8
00:00:24,898 --> 00:00:26,683
Pick a gesture to change.

9
00:00:26,723 --> 00:00:28,633
Tap a gesture to change it.

10
00:00:28,673 --> 00:00:31,783
Double tap does nothing
yet, so give it a job.

11
00:00:32,117 --> 00:00:35,002
Choose an action. Actions come in groups:

12
00:00:35,042 --> 00:00:38,962
the bar, volume, the Deck,
your device, media and system.

13
00:00:39,002 --> 00:00:40,773
Tap one and you are done.

14
00:00:41,089 --> 00:00:43,074
Give an app its own gestures.

15
00:00:43,114 --> 00:00:48,008
Under More, open Gestures for chosen
apps, tap Add and pick the app.

16
00:00:50,307 --> 00:00:52,242
Change a gesture just there.

17
00:00:52,282 --> 00:00:54,667
Set Swipe up to Increase brightness.

18
00:00:54,707 --> 00:00:57,642
In Video, swiping up now
brightens the screen;

19
00:00:57,682 --> 00:00:59,795
everywhere else it works as before.

20
00:01:00,811 --> 00:01:03,418
Up next: Make the bar yours.
